   "color": "#19c6b7",
   "fadeIn": 0.0,
   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "A MOD LOADER, IN THE DEMO.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "This racing demo ships the\ntwo files a mod loader\nuses to inject code.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.591,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the game starts.",
   "start": 4.841,
   "duration": 1.665,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Voxotron, a\nhyper-speed racer where a\nrun lasts thirty seconds\nand there are no brakes.",
   "start": 9.756,
   "duration": 5.427,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. Unity on\nMono, and next to the exe:\nwinhttp.dll, and\ndoorstop_config.ini.",
   "start": 15.433,
   "duration": 9.972,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "That pair is Unity\nDoorstop. Windows loads\nthe fake winhttp, and your\ncode runs before the game\ndoes.",
   "start": 25.655,
   "duration": 6.811,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Whether that's built-in\nmod support or a tool\nnobody removed, a file\nlist can't say.",
   "start": 32.716,
   "duration": 5.322,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
